{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object detected, grab it, check properties, do specific task and move to next location; else scan area for objects. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <SubTree ID = MobileRobotTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInReach    />",
